Reviews start with diffs. Check caller edge cases. Verify changed lifecycle paths run in tests. Report findings promptly. Probe with permission. After denial, source only. Use required native Read. For bugs, run failing regression before source edits, then full suite and diff. Scoped extractions use this rule. Read named callers/tests. Preserve policies/tests. Cover gaps. Run baseline tests before source edits. Batch extraction/removals. Check diff and rerun tests. Use project runner. Prevent bytecode (`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`). Diagnose setup failures. Stop Git after no-repository errors. Load `compound` for unclear conventions, broad refactors, features, performance or PR authoring. Follow project/user instructions. Omit AI commit credits.
